{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经受信开发工具疑似窃取凭据。对应需求：凭据访问。官方：Potential Credential Access via Trusted Developer Utility。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-endpoint.events.library-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经受信开发工具疑似窃取凭据","references":["https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/Binaries/Msbuild/"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"9d110cb3-5f4b-4c9a-b9f5-53f0a1707ae5","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 凭据访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"sequence by process.entity_id\n [process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and (process.name : \"MSBuild.exe\" or process.pe.original_file_name == \"MSBuild.exe\")]\n [library where host.os.type == \"windows\" and dll.name : (\"vaultcli.dll\", \"SAMLib.DLL\")]\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经受信开发工具疑似窃取凭据\n\n### 为何重要\n窃取或中继域与本机凭据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1003","name":"OS Credential Dumping","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1003.002","name":"Security Account Manager","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/002/"}]},{"i